<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-git-staging-view-interface">
  <title>Git Staging View</title>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>Git Staging view</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body>
    <p id="p_pbt_wn5_nsb">The <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol> view is the main interface
      for reviewing changes, staging files, writing commit messages, committing, pushing, and
      pulling. You can open it in any of the following ways:</p>
    <ul id="ul_git_staging_view_access">
      <li id="li_git_staging_view_access_window">Go to <menucascade>
          <uicontrol>Window</uicontrol>
          <uicontrol>Show View</uicontrol>
          <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol>
        </menucascade>.</li>
      <li id="li_git_staging_view_access_tools">Go to <menucascade>
          <uicontrol>Tools</uicontrol>
          Git Client
        </menucascade>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <fig id="fig_tlr_p45_nsb">
        <title>Git Staging View</title>
        <image href="../img/git-addon/staging/staging_view.png" placement="inline" id="image_m3r_f5k_gjc"/>
      </fig>
    </p>
    <section id="section_git_staging_view_layout">
      <title>Main Areas</title>
      <p id="p_git_staging_view_layout_intro">The main areas in the <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol>
        view are:</p>
      <ul id="ul_git_staging_view_main_areas">
        <li id="li_git_staging_toolbar"><xref
            href="#git-addon-git-staging-view-interface/section_git_staging_view_toolbar"><uicontrol>Toolbar</uicontrol></xref></li>
        <li id="li_git_staging_file_areas"><xref
            href="#git-addon-git-staging-view-interface/section_git_staging_file_areas"><uicontrol>Unstaged
              files</uicontrol> area, <uicontrol>Staged files</uicontrol> area, and stage
            controls</xref></li>
        <li id="li_git_staging_commit_area"><xref
            href="#git-addon-git-staging-view-interface/section_git_staging_commit_area"><uicontrol>Commit
              message</uicontrol> area</xref></li>
        <li id="li_git_staging_ellipsis_menu"><xref
            href="#git-addon-git-staging-view-interface/section_git_staging_ellipsis_menu"><uicontrol>Ellipsis</uicontrol>
            menu</xref></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_staging_view_toolbar">
      <title>Toolbar</title>
      <p id="p_git_staging_toolbar_intro">The toolbar contains the main repository-level actions.
        Most of these actions are also available in the top-level <uicontrol>Git</uicontrol>
        menu.</p>
      <ul id="ul_git_staging_toolbar_actions">
        <li id="li_ll5_v45_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts.dita#git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts/action_push"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/PreviousReference16.png" placement="inline" id="image_cbp_g5k_gjc"
              />Push</uicontrol></xref> - Publishes local commits.</li>
        <li id="li_git_staging_fetch_toolbar"><uicontrol>Fetch</uicontrol> - Retrieves updates from all
          configured remotes without merging them into the current branch.</li>
        <li id="li_ik5_1p5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts.dita#git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts/action_pull"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/NextReference16.png" placement="inline" id="image_dbp_g5k_gjc"
              />Pull</uicontrol></xref> - Brings remote commits into the local repository.</li>
        <li id="li_lyq_dp5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-advanced.dita#git-addon-actions-advanced/action_stash"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/Stash18.png" placement="inline" id="image_ebp_g5k_gjc"
              />Stash</uicontrol></xref> drop-down menu - Saves or restores temporary working-copy
          changes.</li>
        <li id="li_mbg_rp5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_show_history"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/History18.png" placement="inline" id="image_fbp_g5k_gjc"/>Show current
              repository history</uicontrol></xref> - Opens repository history.</li>
        <li id="li_fv4_mq5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_show_branches"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/Branch18.png" placement="inline" id="image_gbp_g5k_gjc"/>Show Git
              Branch Manager view</uicontrol></xref> - Opens branch management.</li>
        <li id="li_git_staging_ellipsis_toolbar"><xref
            href="#git-addon-git-staging-view-interface/section_git_staging_ellipsis_menu"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/Ellipsis18.png" placement="inline" id="image_hbp_g5k_gjc"/>Ellipsis</uicontrol>
            menu</xref> - Opens more repository, setup, preferences, and credential actions.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_staging_file_areas">
      <title>File Areas and Stage Controls</title>
      <p id="p_git_staging_file_areas_intro">Use the file areas to decide which changed files belong
        in the next commit.</p>
      <ul id="ul_git_staging_file_areas">
        <li id="li_rcg_nr5_nsb"><uicontrol>Unstaged files</uicontrol> area - Lists changed files that
          are not yet staged.</li>
        <li id="li_tmw_vr5_nsb"><uicontrol>Staged files</uicontrol> area - Lists files that are ready
          to be committed.</li>
      </ul>
      <p id="p_git_staging_file_context_menu_intro">Right-click a file in the file areas to open a
        contextual menu with actions for reviewing, staging, resolving conflicts, discarding changes,
        and viewing file history or blame information.</p>
      <p>
        <fig id="fig_git_staging_context_menu">
          <title>Git Staging File Contextual Menu</title>
          <image href="../img/git-addon/staging/staging_context_menu.png" placement="inline"
            id="image_git_staging_context_menu"/>
        </fig>
      </p>
      <p id="p_git_staging_ignore_submenu_intro">For untracked files, the contextual menu also lets
        you ignore the selected file, its parent directory, or files with the same extension.</p>
      <p>
        <fig id="fig_git_staging_ignore_submenu">
          <title>Git Staging Ignore Submenu</title>
          <image href="../img/git-addon/staging/staging_ignore_submenu.png" placement="inline"
            id="image_git_staging_ignore_submenu"/>
        </fig>
      </p>
      <p id="p_git_staging_stage_controls_intro">The controls between the two file areas include the
        following actions:</p>
      <ul id="ul_gng_s3j_43c">
        <li id="li_jyd_tr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit.dita#git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit/action_stage_selected"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/StageSelected18.png" id="image_vbv_n3j_43c" placement="inline"/>Stage
              selected</uicontrol></xref> - Adds selected files to the next commit.</li>
        <li id="li_rvy_tr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit.dita#git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit/action_stage_all"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/StageAll18.png" id="image_wbv_n3j_43c" placement="inline"/>Stage
              all</uicontrol></xref> - Adds all unstaged files to the next commit.</li>
        <li id="li_wmw_vr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit.dita#git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit/action_unstage_selected"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/UnstageSelected18.png" id="image_brz_43j_43c" placement="inline"/>Unstage
              selected</uicontrol></xref> - Removes selected files from the next commit.</li>
        <li id="li_xmw_vr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit.dita#git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit/action_unstage_all"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/UnstageAll18.png" id="image_crz_43j_43c" placement="inline"/>Unstage
              all</uicontrol></xref> - Removes all staged files from the next commit.</li>
        <li id="li_eh5_5r5_nsb"><uicontrol><image href="../img/Tree18.png" id="image_xbv_n3j_43c"
              placement="inline"/>Switch to tree view</uicontrol> / <uicontrol><image
              href="../img/Flat18.png" id="image_p2p_hjj_43c" placement="inline"/>Switch to list
            view</uicontrol></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_staging_commit_area">
      <title>Commit Message Area</title>
      <p id="p_git_staging_commit_area_intro">Use the <uicontrol>Commit message</uicontrol> area to
        write the message for the staged changes. The following actions are available in the top-right
        corner of the box:</p>
      <ul id="ul_nyj_yr5_nsb">
        <li id="li_tr4_jbs_fdc"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit.dita#git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit/action_generate_commit_message_ai"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/AI-Git16.png" placement="inline" id="image_qsg_35k_gjc"/>Generate
              commit message using AI</uicontrol></xref> - Creates a draft commit message.</li>
        <li id="li_oyj_yr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit.dita#git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit/action_choose_previous_comment"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/PreviousCommit18.png" placement="inline" id="image_rsg_35k_gjc"/>Choose
              a previously used comment</uicontrol></xref> - Reuses an earlier commit message.</li>
        <li id="li_pyj_yr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit.dita#git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit/action_auto_push_after_commit"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/AutoPush18.png" placement="inline" id="image_ssg_35k_gjc"/>Automatically
              push changes to remote branch</uicontrol></xref> - Pushes after the commit.</li>
        <li id="li_qyj_yr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit.dita#git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit/action_amend_last_commit"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/Ammend18.png" placement="inline" id="image_tsg_35k_gjc"/>Amend last
              commit</uicontrol></xref> - Updates the most recent local commit.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <fig id="fig_git_staging_commit_panel">
          <title>Git Staging Commit Message Area</title>
          <image href="../img/git-addon/staging/commit_panel.png" placement="inline"
            id="image_git_staging_commit_panel"/>
        </fig>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_staging_ellipsis_menu">
      <title>Ellipsis Menu</title>
      <p id="p_git_staging_ellipsis_intro">The <uicontrol><image href="../img/Ellipsis18.png"/>Ellipsis</uicontrol>
        menu in the toolbar contains repository, setup, configuration, and credential actions. Some
        actions are also available in the toolbar or in the <uicontrol>Git</uicontrol> menu.</p>
      <p id="p_git_staging_ellipsis_fetch_pull_intro">Use this menu to access synchronization
        actions such as <uicontrol>Push</uicontrol>, <uicontrol>Fetch</uicontrol>, and the
          <uicontrol>Pull</uicontrol> submenu. The <uicontrol>Pull</uicontrol> submenu groups the
        available pull variants in the same way as the main <uicontrol>Git</uicontrol> menu.</p>
      <p>
        <fig id="fig_git_staging_actions_menu">
          <title>Git Staging Ellipsis Menu</title>
          <image href="../img/git-addon/staging/staging_actions_menu.png" placement="inline"
            id="image_git_staging_actions_menu"/>
        </fig>
      </p>
      <ul id="ul_git_staging_ellipsis_actions">
        <li id="li_nmg_2r5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy.dita#git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy/action_clone_repository"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/Add16.png" placement="inline" id="image_qg5_h5k_gjc"/>Clone
              repository...</uicontrol></xref> - Creates a local copy of a remote repository.</li>
        <li id="li_git_staging_create_repository"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy.dita#git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy/action_create_repository_in_project"><uicontrol>Create
              repository in project</uicontrol></xref> - Initializes a repository in the project
          folder.</li>
        <li id="li_git_staging_show_working_copy"><uicontrol>Show working copy in</uicontrol> - Opens a
          submenu for opening the working copy folder outside the editor:
          <ul id="ul_git_staging_show_working_copy_in_actions">
            <li id="li_git_staging_show_working_copy_in_finder"><xref
                href="git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy.dita#git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy/action_show_working_copy_in_finder"><uicontrol>Finder</uicontrol></xref>
              - Opens the working copy folder in Finder.</li>
            <li id="li_git_staging_show_working_copy_in_terminal"><xref
                href="git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy.dita#git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy/action_show_working_copy_in_terminal"><uicontrol>Terminal</uicontrol></xref>
              - Opens the working copy folder in Terminal.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li id="li_pwc_fr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts.dita#git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts/action_push"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/PreviousReference16.png" placement="inline" id="image_rg5_h5k_gjc"
              />Push</uicontrol></xref> - Publishes local commits.</li>
        <li id="li_git_staging_fetch"><uicontrol>Fetch</uicontrol> - Retrieves updates from all configured
          remotes without merging them into the current branch.</li>
        <li id="li_git_staging_pull_submenu"><uicontrol>Pull</uicontrol> - Opens a submenu for
          bringing remote commits into the local repository:
          <ul id="ul_git_staging_pull_actions">
            <li id="li_ofg_fr5_nsb"><xref
                href="git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts.dita#git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts/action_pull_merge"><uicontrol>Pull
                  (merge)</uicontrol></xref> - Pulls and creates a merge commit if needed.</li>
            <li id="li_lzh_fr5_nsb"><xref
                href="git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts.dita#git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts/action_pull_rebase"><uicontrol>Pull
                  (rebase)</uicontrol></xref> - Pulls and reapplies local commits.</li>
            <li id="li_git_staging_pull_other_branch"><xref
                href="git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts.dita#git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts/action_pull_other_branch"><uicontrol>Pull...</uicontrol></xref>
              - Pulls from another remote branch.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li id="li_gfj_fr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_show_branches"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/Branch18.png" placement="inline" id="image_sg5_h5k_gjc"/>Show
              branches</uicontrol></xref> - Opens branch management.</li>
        <li id="li_pfk_fr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_show_tags"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/Tags18.png" placement="inline" id="image_tg5_h5k_gjc"/>Show
              tags...</uicontrol></xref> - Opens tag management.</li>
        <li id="li_ihl_fr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_show_history"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/History18.png" placement="inline" id="image_ug5_h5k_gjc"/>Show
              history</uicontrol></xref> - Opens repository history.</li>
        <li id="li_m3m_fr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-advanced.dita#git-addon-actions-advanced/action_submodule"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/Submodules18.png" placement="inline" id="image_vg5_h5k_gjc"
              />Submodule</uicontrol></xref> - Opens a repository submodule.</li>
        <li id="li_amn_fr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-advanced.dita#git-addon-actions-advanced/action_stash_changes"><uicontrol>Stash
              changes...</uicontrol></xref> - Saves working-copy changes for later.</li>
        <li id="li_fn4_fr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-advanced.dita#git-addon-actions-advanced/action_list_stashes"><uicontrol>List
              stashes...</uicontrol></xref> - Lists saved stashes.</li>
        <li id="li_sqp_fr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-configuration.dita#git-addon-actions-configuration/action_manage_remote_repositories"><uicontrol><image
                href="../img/Remote18.png" placement="inline" id="image_wg5_h5k_gjc"/>Manage remote
              repositories...</uicontrol></xref> - Adds, edits, or deletes remotes.</li>
        <li id="li_etq_fr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_track_remote_branch"><uicontrol>Track
              remote branch...</uicontrol></xref> - Sets the branch used for fetch, pull, and
          push.</li>
        <li id="li_prr_fr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-configuration.dita#git-addon-actions-configuration/action_edit_repository_config_file"><uicontrol>Edit
              repository "config" file</uicontrol></xref> - Opens the repository configuration file.</li>
        <li id="li_git_staging_ignore_actions"><uicontrol>Ignore</uicontrol> - Opens a submenu for
          opening the repository <filepath>.gitignore</filepath> file or the global ignore file.</li>
        <li id="li_eps_fr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-configuration.dita#git-addon-actions-configuration/action_preferences"><uicontrol>Preferences</uicontrol></xref>
          - Opens the Git Client preferences page.</li>
        <li id="li_qnt_fr5_nsb"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-configuration.dita#git-addon-actions-configuration/action_reset_all_credentials"><uicontrol>Reset
              all credentials</uicontrol></xref> - Clears stored Git credentials.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <fig id="fig_git_staging_ignore_actions_submenu">
          <title>Git Staging Ignore Actions Submenu</title>
          <image href="../img/git-addon/staging/staging_ignore_actions_submenu.png" placement="inline"
            id="image_git_staging_ignore_actions_submenu"/>
        </fig>
      </p>
    </section>
  </body>
</topic>